{"id":"n41103-1-7","stage":4,"title":"널리다 · 被晾","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41103-1-7-1","ko":"아직도 마당에 빨래가 널려 있던데 왜 안 걷어 와?","zh":"院子里怎么还晾着衣服啊？怎么还不收进来？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아직도","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아직도","audio":"/audio/902d7e7542f94724da66.mp3"}},{"text":"마당에","meaning":"院子，庭院","explanation":"마당：院子，庭院；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"마당","audio":"/audio/bcf71a239bbaaf8d1e52.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15687","senseId":"1","lemma":"마당","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마당에","audio":"/audio/bf749310d49592734a97.mp3"}},{"text":"빨래가","meaning":"要洗的衣服，洗完的衣服","explanation":"빨래：要洗的衣服，洗完的衣服；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"빨래","audio":"/audio/811f604d9f69b6be72e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66638","senseId":"2","lemma":"빨래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빨래가","audio":"/audio/ef7fae72438755af5cda.mp3"}},{"text":"널려","meaning":"被晾，被晒","explanation":"널리다：被晾，被晒；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"널리다","audio":"/audio/adb17b65358ce51db76a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41103","senseId":"1","lemma":"널리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"널려","audio":"/audio/6261d61844acdc82fa47.mp3"}},{"text":"있던데","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；던데：回顾亲历的情况，作为后文的背景或对比。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있던데","audio":"/audio/dffc6ee2c8b9831232f1.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.