ion":["읻따"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"82e3bb1b27351e4d","term":"걷다","zh":"收，收拾","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3","entryId":"15933","definition":"把散开的东西聚到一处。","pronunciation":["걷따"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"出现运气、意义或机会等。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c72c6d906972391010f8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n41103-1-7-2","ko":"빨래가 덜 말랐어요.","zh":"衣服还没干呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"빨래가","meaning":"要洗的衣服，洗完的衣服","explanation":"빨래：要洗的衣服，洗完的衣服；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"빨래","audio":"/audio/811f604d9f69b6be72e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66638","senseId":"2","lemma":"빨래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빨래가","audio":"/audio/ef7fae72438755af5cda.mp3"}},{"text":"덜","meaning":"不够，不大，还没有","explanation":"덜：不够，不大，还没有。","readings":[{"term":"덜","audio":"/audio/f065d425b7fad87eff3e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48653","senseId":"1","lemma":"덜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"덜","audio":"/audio/f065d425b7fad87eff3e.mp3"}},{"text":"말랐어요.","meaning":"干","explanation":"마르다：干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"마르다","audio":"/audio/6cd2f7184df80453aa2c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64677","senseId":"1","lemma":"마르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말랐어요","audio":"/audio/39a5a2d38623283f652b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"811f604d9f69b6be","term":"빨래","zh":"要洗的衣服，洗完的衣服","audio":"/audio/811f604d9f69b6be72e0.mp3","entryId":"66638","definition":"需要清洗或已经清洗过的衣物。","pronunciation":["빨래"]},{"id":"f065d425b7fad87e","term":"덜","zh":"不够，不大